  "description": "In a peaceful, quiet rural village, four “brothers” live together with their “Father.” The brothers devote themselves to Father, and Father showers them with love. At first glance, they appear to be a perfectly harmonious “family.”\n\nHowever, when the night of the “ritual” arrives, something about their relationship begins to feel strangely unsettling. The ritual is performed for a single purpose: “to pray for everyone’s prosperity and happiness.” Every member of the community has always devoted themselves wholeheartedly to fulfilling that one purpose.\n\nBut one day, cracks begin to form within this once-happy and flourishing community. How will the relationship between the four “brothers,” all centered around “Father,” begin to change?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jebu)",
